<title>JAPAN: BOJ refrains from regular money market operation.</title>
<headline>BOJ refrains from regular money market operation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan refrained from its regular 0020 GMT money market operation on Friday, money traders said.</p>
